{"ticker":"LTFOODS","symbol":"LTFOODS","instrumentId":3099249,"name":"Lt Foods","industry":"NSE-Food-Misc Preparation","about":"LT Foods Ltd. is a leading global food company primarily engaged in the production, processing, and marketing of rice, organic foods, and ready-to-eat products. Renowned for its flagship brands Daawat and Royal, LT Foods offers premium basmati rice and a variety of rice-based products to consumers in over 60 countries. The company focuses on sustainable sourcing and innovative packaging, providing high-quality, healthy food options that cater to modern lifestyles. In addition to rice, LT Foods offers organic staples, snacks, and convenience foods, meeting the growing demand for nutritious and easy-to-cook products. The company’s commitment to quality and sustainability drives its success in international markets.","website":"www.ltgroup.in","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:37:25.313Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":438.75,"changePct":4.651162790697675,"week52High":459,"week52Low":337.25},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹15,236 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹12,102 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"170,153,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"182"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"67,819,126"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.46%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.37"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"3.5"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"0.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.05"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.5"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"19%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"23.2"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"8–28"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"13.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"26.22"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,302,538"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,021,882"},{"label":"Master score","value":"56"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"66"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"69"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"13